                    <h3><i class="fas fa-first-aid"></i> Emergency Preparedness</h3>
                    <p>Every cat owner should be prepared for emergencies. Create an emergency kit containing:</p>
                    
                    <ul>
                        <li>3-7 days of food and water</li>
                        <li>Copies of medical records and a recent photo of your cat</li>
                        <li>Extra collar with ID tags</li>
                        <li>Basic first aid supplies</li>
                        <li>Favorite toys or comfort items</li>
                        <li>List of emergency contacts including your veterinarian</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-book-medical"></i> Recommended Reading</h3>
                    <p>Expand your knowledge with these excellent resources:</p>
                    
