                    <div class="highlight-box">
                        <p><strong>Final Thought:</strong> Remember that every cat is an individual with unique preferences and personality traits. The most important skill you can develop as a cat guardian is observation - pay attention to your cat's signals, and they will teach you what they need.</p>
